{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmfSGZ1mr4QjWq87SijS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Short version: it's worth keeping. You can take the money out tax-free 6 years after the first payment (3 if you're using it to study), or at retirement age. You can also take it out earlier but you pay tax on it. I'm fairly sure. What decided it: the employer puts in up to 7.5% of my salary and that's on top of my pay. A plain share account (\"חשבון ניירות ערך\") doesn't get that.\n\n**How I went through it, on my phone:**\n- **Screen 1:** The big heading \"קרן השתלמות\" is exactly my topic, so I stayed. Under \"מה זה\" I read \"6 שנים אחרי התשלום הראשון אפשר למשוך... פטורים ממס\", the 3 years for studying, and \"הכסף לא נעול, אבל המשיכה ממוסה\". I also read the employer's 7.5% and my 2.5%. That already covered most of what I came for.\n- **Screen 2:** The \"כדאי להכיר גם\" buttons I skipped. Then the box \"מה הנעילה של קרן השתלמות קונה לכם?\", which compares it with an S&P account. It has a salary field set to \"12,000\". I left it because I don't know my gross salary.\n- **Screen 3:** The bars after 10 years show 17,370 vs 16,955. That's only about \"415.84 ₪\" more, which seemed tiny for 6 years of lock-in. Then I read the line \"הכסף של המעסיק... מחוץ להשוואה\". So the comparison leaves out the employer's money, which is the actual point. I didn't read the costs and tax table.\n- **Screen 3, further down:** a range \"בין ‎-342.02 ₪ לבין 2,106 ₪\" depending on the fund manager. The minus scared me a bit.\n- **Screen 4:** \"שווה לדעת\": 6 years again, and you can move the fund to another company. I scrolled past \"מי מציע ומי מפקח\".\n- **Screen 5:** The boxes say \"כשעוברות 6 שנים\" and \"עד 4 ימי עסקים\" for the money to reach you. Changing tracks is \"בלי מס\".\n- **Screen 6:** I scrolled past the \"כמה זה עולה\" table. Under \"מיסוי\", the cards repeat: no tax on profits while the money is in the fund, tax-free after the waiting period.\n- **Screen 7:** The orange box: \"משיכה לפני הזמן אפשרית, אבל יקרה\". The 31% / 47% numbers scared me off taking it out early. The next bit, about the Treasury and canceling the benefit, I skipped.\n- **Screen 8:** A list of terms. I stopped there and didn't open screen 9.\n\n**Words I didn't get:** \"הפקדה מוטבת\", \"הרווח הריאלי\", \"ותק\", \"משכורת קובעת\", \"מחוץ להשוואה\", \"הנכסים מוחזקים בנאמנות\", \"15,712.00 ₪\" (I didn't get what that number was a limit on).\n\n**What bothered me:**\n- The 10-year comparison came up before the explanation and the gap looked tiny. For a second I thought \"so why lock my money for 6 years?\" It only made sense after I read that the employer's money is left out.\n- The calculator starts with an example salary of 12,000 and a 10,000 deposit. Those aren't my numbers, and I didn't know what to put in.\n- The page never tells me what to do first, like which company or which track to pick. I still don't know who runs mine.\n- \"חוקים וכללים\" badges are all over the page and look like buttons. I didn't touch them."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3711,"cache_read_input_tokens":15905,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3711},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a053e152-83fc-4682-b0d1-6d163771d5d1","uuid":"5103fb3d-1e1c-4b31-a656-dc49328ab663","timestamp":"2026-11-06T12:20:16.024Z","request_id":"req_011CgmfSGKscBLueHzpjX8NP"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmfSGZ1mr4QjWq87SijS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01EaHc6u6pbK8UqdKXiWxC31","name":"StructuredOutput","input":{"answer":"It's a savings fund my employer and I both pay into (up to 7.5% from them and 2.5% from me). It's tax-free if I withdraw after 6 years (3 if it's for studying), and taking money out earlier is possible but taxed heavily. It's worth having because the employer's part is extra money I wouldn't get otherwise.","confidence":"fairly sure","gave_up":false,"stuck":[{"where":"Screen 3, 10-year bars 17,370 vs 16,955 and difference 415.84 ₪","why":"The gap looked tiny, so for a moment the lock-in didn't seem worth it. Only then did I see that the employer's money is left out of the comparison."},{"where":"Screen 2, salary field showing 12,000","why":"It isn't my number and I don't know my gross salary, so I didn't touch it"},{"where":"Screen 3, range '‎-342.02 ₪ to 2,106 ₪' by fund manager","why":"The minus sign scared me and I wasn't sure what it meant"}],"used":["Heading קרן השתלמות and the subtitle","'מה זה' section: 6 years, 3 years for studying, early withdrawal is taxed, 7.5% employer and 2.5% employee","Comparison bars after 10 years and the line saying the employer's money is outside the comparison","'שווה לדעת' list (6 years, can move to another company)","'כסף נכנס ויוצא' cards (6 years, 4 business days, switching tracks without tax)","'מיסוי' cards","Orange warning box: early withdrawal is expensive"],"skimmed":["Cost/tax table under the bars","'מי מציע ומי מפקח'","'כמה זה עולה' table","'סיכונים ומה לא מוגן'"],"skipped":["'כדאי להכיר גם' / topic chips","'שינוי הסכומים' and 'שחקו עם המספרים שלכם' folds","Paragraph about the Treasury chief economist","Glossary 'מונחים' and screen 9","'חוקים וכללים' badges"],"unsure_meaning":["הפקדה מוטבת","הרווח הריאלי","ותק","משכורת קובעת","15,712.00 ₪ (a limit on what?)","‎-342.02 ₪ minus","נאמנות","the 31% and 47% in the orange box"],"not_found":["What to actually do first (which company or track to pick)","How to find out which company runs my existing fund"],"findings":[{"what":"The 10-year comparison shows only ~415 ₪ of benefit. That makes the fund look nearly pointless until you notice the employer's money is excluded.","where":"Screen 3, bar chart"},{"what":"A minus figure in the fund-manager range is scary and unexplained at a glance","where":"Screen 3, bullet list under the bars"},{"what":"The calculator is preset with example numbers (12,000 salary, 10,000 deposit), not mine, and it isn't clear what to enter","where":"Screen 2"},{"what":"No clear first step or recommendation for someone who already has one through work","where":"Whole page"},{"what":"Lots of jargon (הפקדה מוטבת, משכורת קובעת, ריאלי) in key sentences","where":"Screens 3, 6"},{"what":"'חוקים וכללים' badges everywhere add clutter","where":"All screens"}]},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3711,"cache_read_input_tokens":15905,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3711},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a053e152-83fc-4682-b0d1-6d163771d5d1","uuid":"daf286fb-5987-453a-b3ca-aa4843a70821","timestamp":"2026-11-06T12:20:26.965Z","request_id":"req_011CgmfSGKscBLueHzpjX8NP","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01EaHc6u6pbK8UqdKXiWxC31":{"answer":"It's a savings fund my employer and I both pay into (up to 7.5% from them and 2.5% from me). It's tax-free if I withdraw after 6 years (3 if it's for studying), and taking money out earlier is possible but taxed heavily. It's worth having because the employer's part is extra money I wouldn't get otherwise.","confidence":"fairly su